    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/9ff8da890ba7cc936ed23615a7e3e636.poster.avif?t=1654692717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/9ff8da890ba7cc936ed23615a7e3e636.webm?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/9ff8da890ba7cc936ed23615a7e3e636.mp4?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Over 2.4 million unique weapon combinations and counting<br><br>Ancient machine demons prey on the last surviving people. Remaining survivors must build powerful weapons to rival the machine demons might.<br><br>Create the ultimate weapon with over 2.4 million possible combinations and counting. Engage enemies far with sniper grenade launcher. Get up-close and personal with automatic shotgun with exploding bolts. Near limitless combinations<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/963364b4f4aa250e106f10948782e3e1.poster.avif?t=1654692717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/963364b4f4aa250e106f10948782e3e1.webm?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/963364b4f4aa250e106f10948782e3e1.mp4?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Destroy enemy strongholds and fight increasingly difficult waves of enemies for legendary loot.  Each level the enemy difficulty increases, but so does the loot quality<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/b94cba1d409e86a6fdfec3f9f1ecea99.poster.avif?t=1654692717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/b94cba1d409e86a6fdfec3f9f1ecea99.webm?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/b94cba1d409e86a6fdfec3f9f1ecea99.mp4?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Unlock new characters each with their own unique vehicle and skills.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/b83b088fd2384a192a8137185a157104.poster.avif?t=1654692717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/b83b088fd2384a192a8137185a157104.webm?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1626850/extras/b83b088fd2384a192a8137185a157104.mp4?t=1654692717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
